        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Me is a minimalist Arena Fighter and Battle Royale </strong>that is very easy to learn, but difficult to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds of 1v1 Me begin with your opponent  on the opposite end of a large, dark arena. There are 5 maps, each emphasizing different playstyles. <strong>Kill your opponent to win a round. The first to win 3 rounds wins the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Games of 1v1 Me can be as short as 3 minutes to a max of 15, making it the perfect game when you're short on time</strong> or to quickly settle petty disputes with friends like &quot;Who's the better player?&quot; or &quot;Who's buying pizza tonight?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your creativity is your only limit in combat.</strong> Armed with a sword, a gun, and blinding speed,  combine your abilities to find success on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize mind games, conditioning, and create fear in your opponent to catch them off guard. <strong>Keeping a clear mind is critical to your survival.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Me is a minimalist Arena Fighter and Battle Royale </strong>that is very easy to learn, but difficult to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds of 1v1 Me begin with your opponent  on the opposite end of a large, dark arena. There are 5 maps, each emphasizing different playstyles. <strong>Kill your opponent to win a round. The first to win 3 rounds wins the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Games of 1v1 Me can be as short as 3 minutes to a max of 15, making it the perfect game when you're short on time</strong> or to quickly settle petty disputes with friends like &quot;Who's the better player?&quot; or &quot;Who's buying pizza tonight?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your creativity is your only limit in combat.</strong> Armed with a sword, a gun, and blinding speed,  combine your abilities to find success on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize mind games, conditioning, and create fear in your opponent to catch them off guard. <strong>Keeping a clear mind is critical to your survival.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "JUST. PLAY. BETTER. Use your powers as a living machine to shoot, dash, and slash through enemies as you outplay your opponents in a duel to the death in the dark. 1v1 Me is an easy to learn, but difficult to master arena fighter! Surpass your limits, right here, right now in 1v1 Me!",
